msgstr "ເລີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຕັກໂນໂລຊີຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອດ້ານການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້"

#: schemas/org.mate.applications-at-mobility.gschema.xml:11
msgid ""
"MATE to start preferred Mobility assistive technology application during "
